('apple-iphone-16-pro-max-1tb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max 1TB', 'smartphones', 2800000, 2800000, 2240000, 8, 0.23, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-1tb.jpg', 'The pinnacle of smartphone innovation. Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max features the groundbreaking A18 Pro chip built on 3nm architecture delivering desktop-class performance, a massive 6.9-inch Super Retina XDR ProMotion display with 120Hz adaptive refresh rate and 2000 nits peak brightness, and the most advanced pro camera system ever in an iPhone with a 48MP Fusion camera, 48MP Ultra Wide, and 12MP 5x Telephoto lens with sensor-shift optical image stabilization. Encased in aerospace-grade titanium with a textured matte glass back, it offers 1TB of storage for professional workflows, all-day battery life with up to 33 hours of video playback, USB-C 3.2 Gen 2 with up to 10Gbps transfer speeds, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, Thread networking, and iOS 19 with Apple Intelligence. Every detail engineered for professionals, content creators, and those who demand nothing less than the absolute best.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 2240000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-1tb.jpg', 2464000, 4.9, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-16-pro-max-512gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max 512GB', 'smartphones', 2400000, 2400000, 1920000, 10, 0.23, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-512gb.jpg', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max with 512GB storage delivers the ultimate smartphone experience. Powered by the A18 Pro chip with a 16-core Neural Engine and dedicated AV1 decoder, it handles 8K video editing, console-level gaming, and AI-powered tasks with remarkable efficiency. The 6.9-inch LTPO Super Retina XDR display features Always-On technology, Dynamic Island, and industry-leading color accuracy at 2000 nits peak brightness. The pro camera array includes a 48MP main sensor with second-generation sensor-shift OIS, 48MP Ultra Wide with autofocus for macro photography, and a 12MP telephoto with 5x optical zoom. Titanium construction reduces weight while improving durability. Features include USB-C 3.2, Action button, Camera Control button, MagSafe 2, and Ceramic Shield front cover. Engineered for those who create, capture, and compute without compromise.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1920000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-512gb.jpg', 2112000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-16-pro-max-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro Max 256GB', 'smartphones', 1999000, 1999000, 1599200, 15, 0.23, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 16 Pro Max 256GB represents the perfect balance of premium storage and flagship capability. At its heart beats the A18 Pro processor with hardware-accelerated ray tracing and mesh shading for console-quality gaming, paired with a 16-core Neural Engine that powers Apple Intelligence features including real-time language translation, advanced photo editing, and personalized Siri interactions. The 6.9-inch ProMotion OLED display with Dynamic Island delivers buttery-smooth scrolling and vibrant HDR content. Photography reaches new heights with the 48MP Fusion camera system featuring Smart HDR 6, Photonic Engine, and next-generation portraits with Focus and Depth Control. Video professionals will appreciate ProRes 4K at 120fps, spatial video capture, and Academy Color Encoding System workflows. With iOS 19, titanium frame, satellite connectivity, and Emergency SOS, this device sets the standard for what a smartphone can achieve.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1599200, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 1759120, 4.9, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-16-pro-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro 256GB', 'smartphones', 1600000, 1600000, 1280000, 12, 0.20, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-256gb.jpg', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro brings pro-level innovation in a perfectly sized 6.3-inch form factor. The A18 Pro chip delivers uncompromising performance with a 6-core GPU featuring ray tracing acceleration, 6-core CPU with next-generation machine learning accelerators, and a 16-core Neural Engine capable of 35 trillion operations per second. The Super Retina XDR ProMotion display with 120Hz adaptive refresh reaches 2000 nits for stunning outdoor visibility. The triple-camera system includes a 48MP Fusion camera, 48MP Ultra Wide, and 12MP 5x Telephoto all benefiting from the Photonic Engine and Deep Fusion computational photography. ProRes video, spatial audio recording, and four studio-quality microphones enable professional content creation. Built with Grade 5 titanium, Ceramic Shield, and industry-leading IP68 water resistance. Features USB-C 3.2, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4, and ultra-wideband chip. The iPhone 16 Pro is the professional''s choice for power in a compact design.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1280000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-256gb.jpg', 1408000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-16-pro-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Pro 128GB', 'smartphones', 1450000, 1450000, 1160000, 18, 0.20, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-128gb.jpg', 'iPhone 16 Pro with 128GB storage delivers the core pro experience at an accessible price point. The A18 Pro chip powers through demanding apps, immersive games with hardware ray tracing, and AI-enhanced workflows. The 6.3-inch LTPO OLED display with ProMotion, Always-On technology, and Dynamic Island provides an adaptive visual experience from 1Hz to 120Hz. The revolutionary Camera Control button gives instant access to photographic tools with haptic feedback and pressure sensitivity. The camera system features a 48MP main sensor, 48MP Ultra Wide with 120° field of view, and 12MP 5x telephoto all enhanced by the Photonic Engine for extraordinary detail and color. Titanium frame, USB-C connectivity, Action button customization, MagSafe 2, and the most advanced iPhone security with Face ID make this the definitive pro smartphone. iOS 19 with Apple Intelligence completes the ecosystem experience.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1160000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-pro-128gb.jpg', 1276000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-16-plus-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 Plus 256GB', 'smartphones', 1400000, 1400000, 1120000, 15, 0.20, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-plus-256gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 16 Plus with 256GB combines a spacious 6.7-inch display with the powerful A18 chip. The large Super Retina XDR OLED display with 2000 nits peak brightness is perfect for content consumption, gaming, and creative work. The A18 processor delivers a 30% CPU performance boost and 40% GPU improvement over its predecessor, with hardware-accelerated ray tracing for next-generation mobile gaming. The advanced dual-camera system features a 48MP main camera with 2x telephoto-quality zoom and a 12MP Ultra Wide with autofocus for macro photography. Smart HDR 6, Photonic Engine, and next-gen portraits deliver professional-quality images. With up to 26 hours of video playback, USB-C connectivity, Action button, Dynamic Island, and iOS 19, the iPhone 16 Plus is the ideal large-screen iPhone for users who want premium features without the pro price tag. Available in five stunning colors.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1120000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-plus-256gb.jpg', 1232000, 4.7, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-16-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 16 128GB', 'smartphones', 1100000, 1100000, 880000, 25, 0.17, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-128gb.jpg', 'iPhone 16 brings the power of Apple Intelligence to everyone. The A18 chip with a 5-core GPU and 16-core Neural Engine delivers extraordinary performance for apps, games, and AI features. The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with 2000 nits peak brightness, Dynamic Island, and HDR support makes everything look stunning. The camera system takes a leap forward with a 48MP Fusion camera offering 2x optical-quality zoom, 12MP Ultra Wide, and spatial photo and video capture. The Action button provides instant access to favorite features, while USB-C connectivity simplifies charging and data transfer. Ceramic Shield front, aerospace-grade aluminum frame, and IP68 water resistance ensure durability. With all-day battery life up to 22 hours video, iOS 19, satellite connectivity for emergencies, and Apple Intelligence for personalized assistance, iPhone 16 delivers the complete modern smartphone experience at an exceptional value.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 880000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-16-128gb.jpg', 968000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-iphone-15-pro-max-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 15 Pro Max 256GB', 'smartphones', 1250000, 1250000, 1000000, 20, 0.22, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 'Apple iPhone 15 Pro Max continues to dominate as a premium flagship with its revolutionary titanium design the first in any smartphone making it both incredibly strong and noticeably lighter. The A17 Pro chip features a new 6-core GPU with hardware-accelerated ray tracing for console-quality gaming and pro creative workflows. The 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR ProMotion display with Dynamic Island and Always-On technology delivers vibrant colors and smooth 120Hz scrolling. Photography reaches professional heights with the 48MP main camera system offering multiple focal lengths (24mm, 28mm, 35mm), 12MP Ultra Wide, and 12MP 5x Telephoto with 3D sensor-shift OIS. Next-generation portraits with Focus and Depth Control, Smart HDR 5, and ProRes 4K at 60fps enable cinema-grade content creation. USB-C 3.0 with 10Gbps transfer, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, Thread networking, and Roadside Assistance via satellite. A versatile, powerful tool for professional users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1000000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 1100000, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-15-pro-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 15 Pro 128GB', 'smartphones', 980000, 980000, 784000, 18, 0.21, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-pro-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 15 Pro in a compact 6.1-inch form factor delivers the full pro experience. A17 Pro chip, the industry''s first 3nm processor, provides remarkable performance and efficiency for demanding applications, AAA gaming, and professional workflows. The aerospace-grade titanium frame with contoured edges feels exceptional in hand while maintaining IP68 water and dust resistance. The pro camera system features a 48MP main camera with advanced quad-pixel sensor, 12MP Ultra Wide, and 12MP 3x Telephoto, all enhanced by the Photonic Engine. The customizable Action button replaces the mute switch for instant access to camera, voice memos, accessibility features, or custom Shortcuts. USB-C connectivity supports up to 10Gbps data transfer, DisplayPort output for external monitors, and universal charging. Super Retina XDR ProMotion display, iOS 18 support with Apple Intelligence readiness, and Roadside Assistance via satellite make this a highly capable device.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 784000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-pro-128gb.jpg', 862400, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-15-plus-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 15 Plus 128GB', 'smartphones', 850000, 850000, 680000, 20, 0.20, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-plus-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 15 Plus delivers an expansive 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR display with Dynamic Island in a beautifully designed package. The A16 Bionic chip with 5-core GPU and 6-core CPU powers through intensive tasks, gaming, and augmented reality experiences with fluid efficiency. The dual-camera system features a 48MP main camera with quad-pixel sensor and sensor-shift OIS, plus a 12MP Ultra Wide lens, enabling next-generation portraits with automatic depth capture and Focus/Depth Control even after the shot. Smart HDR 5, Photonic Engine, and 4K Cinematic mode elevate content creation. USB-C connectivity simplifies the charging ecosystem, while MagSafe provides convenient wireless charging and accessory attachment. All-day battery life up to 26 hours video playback, IP68 water resistance, Ceramic Shield front cover, and a color-infused glass back with aerospace-grade aluminum frame in five colors. iOS 18, Crash Detection, and Emergency SOS via satellite provide peace of mind.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 680000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-plus-128gb.jpg', 748000, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-15-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 15 128GB', 'smartphones', 850000, 850000, 680000, 28, 0.17, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 15 represents a significant leap forward for the standard iPhone line. Featuring the Dynamic Island that fluidly adapts to show alerts, notifications, and live activities, the 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR display with 2000 nits peak brightness is twice as bright as iPhone 14 and stunning in sunlight. The A16 Bionic chip with its 16-core Neural Engine delivers powerful, efficient performance for all-day use. The 48MP main camera is a transformative upgrade, capturing extraordinary detail and enabling a 2x optical-quality Telephoto for framing flexibility. Next-generation portraits launch automatically when a person, dog, or cat is detected, with the ability to adjust focus after capture. USB-C connectivity, precision-finding Find My with second-gen Ultra Wideband chip, and MagSafe wireless charging ecosystem support enhance daily use. With a color-infused back glass, contoured aluminum edges, IP68 rating, and five vibrant colors, iPhone 15 offers exceptional value in the current Apple ecosystem.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 680000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-15-128gb.jpg', 748000, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1),

('apple-iphone-14-pro-max-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max 256GB', 'smartphones', 950000, 950000, 760000, 22, 0.24, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 14 Pro Max remains a powerhouse choice with its stunning 6.7-inch LTPO Super Retina XDR ProMotion display (1-120Hz) featuring the ingenious Dynamic Island that transforms notifications into fluid, interactive experiences. The A16 Bionic chipset with a 5-core GPU, 6-core CPU, and 16-core Neural Engine delivers industry-leading performance and power efficiency for demanding tasks like 4K video editing, high-end gaming, and computational photography. The professional-grade triple camera system is led by a 48MP main sensor with quad-pixel technology, second-generation sensor-shift OIS, and f/1.78 aperture for exceptional low-light photography. The 12MP Ultra Wide with autofocus enables stunning macro photography, while the 12MP 3x Telephoto provides versatile zoom. ProRAW, ProRes 4K at 30fps, Action mode, and Cinematic mode at 4K HDR 30fps offer filmmakers incredible creative flexibility. With stainless steel and Ceramic Shield design, MagSafe, satellite Emergency SOS, Crash Detection, and iOS 18 support, it remains a formidable flagship.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 760000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 836000, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-14-pro-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 14 Pro 128GB', 'smartphones', 750000, 750000, 600000, 20, 0.22, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-pro-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 14 Pro in its compact 6.1-inch form delivers uncompromising flagship performance. The A16 Bionic chipset offers class-leading speed, graphical prowess, and energy efficiency, tackling everything from console-quality games to advanced AR applications and machine learning tasks. The ProMotion display with Always-On technology and Dynamic Island provides an adaptive, information-rich interface that redefines smartphone interaction. The triple-camera array features a breakthrough 48MP main camera with quad-pixel sensor that excels in all lighting conditions, plus 12MP Ultra Wide and 12MP 3x Telephoto lenses. Macro photography, ProRAW capture with incredible detail retention, and Cinematic mode in 4K HDR at 24 or 30fps elevate professional content creation. The surgical-grade stainless steel frame with textured matte glass back, Ceramic Shield front cover, and IP68 rating ensure durability and premium aesthetics. MagSafe, Emergency SOS via satellite, Crash Detection, and iOS 18 compatibility make it a compelling premium device with lasting value.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 600000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-pro-128gb.jpg', 660000, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-14-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 14 128GB', 'smartphones', 680000, 680000, 544000, 35, 0.17, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 14 delivers a refined experience with the A15 Bionic chip (5-core GPU version) providing ample performance for everyday tasks, gaming, and photography. The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with Ceramic Shield protection offers rich colors, deep blacks, and HDR support at up to 1200 nits peak brightness. The dual-camera system features a 12MP main camera with sensor-shift optical image stabilization and a faster f/1.5 aperture for dramatically improved low-light performance, along with a 12MP Ultra Wide lens with 120° field of view. Photonic Engine computational photography enhances mid-to-low light performance across all cameras. Action mode provides gimbal-smooth video stabilization, while Cinematic mode now supports 4K HDR at 30fps and 4K at 24fps. Crash Detection, Emergency SOS via satellite, and the durable aerospace-grade aluminum design with IP68 water resistance provide exceptional safety and longevity. iOS 18 support ensures years of updates.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 544000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-14-128gb.jpg', 598400, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-13-pro-max-256gb', 'Apple iPhone 13 Pro Max 256GB', 'smartphones', 850000, 850000, 680000, 18, 0.24, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 13 Pro Max continues as a highly sought-after flagship with its expansive 6.7-inch Super Retina XDR ProMotion display offering adaptive 10-120Hz refresh rates for buttery-smooth scrolling and responsive touch. The A15 Bionic chip delivers exceptional performance for gaming, video editing, and multitasking with outstanding power efficiency. The pro camera system introduces macro photography with the new Ultra Wide lens featuring autofocus, allowing subjects as close as 2cm. All three rear cameras (12MP Telephoto with 3x optical zoom, 12MP Wide with sensor-shift OIS and f/1.5 aperture, 12MP Ultra Wide with 120° FOV) now support Night mode. Photographic Styles apply personalized looks in real-time, while ProRes video and ProRAW photo formats enable professional post-processing. Cinematic mode with rack focus creates depth-of-field transitions. With a stainless steel frame, Ceramic Shield, IP68 rating, and the largest battery ever in an iPhone at launch, it remains a reliable, high-performance workhorse with iOS 18 support.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 680000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-pro-max-256gb.jpg', 748000, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-13-pro-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 13 Pro 128GB', 'smartphones', 650000, 650000, 520000, 30, 0.20, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-pro-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 13 Pro packs professional capabilities into a perfectly sized 6.1-inch design. The A15 Bionic chip with 5-core GPU provides ample performance headroom for demanding apps, immersive AR experiences, and graphics-intensive games. The ProMotion display with adaptive refresh rates up to 120Hz delivers an ultra-responsive and efficient visual experience. The triple 12MP camera system Telephoto (3x optical), Wide (sensor-shift OIS, f/1.5), and Ultra Wide (120° FOV, macro) covers every photographic scenario. Night mode across all cameras, Photographic Styles for personalized toning, and ProRAW/ProRes support provide professional-grade creative control. Cinematic mode automatically creates depth effects and focus transitions. The flat-edge surgical-grade stainless steel design with textured matte glass back and Ceramic Shield front remains premium and durable. MagSafe, IP68 water resistance, and the powerful Neural Engine complete this still very capable professional device with iOS 18 support.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 520000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-pro-128gb.jpg', 572000, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-iphone-13-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 13 128GB', 'smartphones', 520000, 520000, 416000, 25, 0.17, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-128gb.jpg', 'iPhone 13 remains one of the most popular iPhones globally, offering a compelling mix of performance and value. The A15 Bionic chip ensures fast, fluid performance for apps, gaming, and the latest iOS 18 features. The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR display is 28% brighter than iPhone 12 at 800 nits typical and 1200 nits peak for HDR, with striking colors and deep blacks. The dual-camera system features sensor-shift optical image stabilization on the 12MP Wide camera a feature previously exclusive to the Pro Max delivering dramatically better low-light photos and smoother video. The 12MP Ultra Wide provides a 120° field of view. Photographic Styles, Smart HDR 4, and Cinematic mode with Dolby Vision recording bring advanced computational photography to everyone. The flat-edge aluminum design with Ceramic Shield front cover is IP68 water resistant. With MagSafe, 5G connectivity, and outstanding battery life up to 19 hours video playback, the iPhone 13 continues to deliver excellent long-term value.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 416000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-13-128gb.jpg', 457600, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

('apple-iphone-12-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 12 128GB', 'smartphones', 380000, 380000, 304000, 20, 0.16, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-12-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 12 ushered in the era of 5G and MagSafe for Apple. The A14 Bionic chip the first 5nm chip in any smartphone delivers outstanding performance and efficiency for everyday use, gaming, and photography. The 6.1-inch Super Retina XDR OLED display with 2532 x 1170 resolution, HDR10, and Dolby Vision support provides incredible contrast and color accuracy at up to 1200 nits peak brightness. The dual 12MP camera system features a Wide lens with f/1.6 aperture (27% more light than iPhone 11) and an Ultra Wide lens with 120° field of view. Night mode is available on both cameras, along with Deep Fusion and Smart HDR 3 for detailed, natural-looking images. The flat-edge aerospace-grade aluminum design with Ceramic Shield (4x better drop performance) marks a return to the beloved iPhone 4/5 aesthetic. IP68 water resistance to 6 meters for 30 minutes, MagSafe wireless charging, and compatibility with the latest iOS 18 make this a fantastic entry-level 5G iPhone.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 304000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-12-128gb.jpg', 334400, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

('apple-iphone-11-128gb', 'Apple iPhone 11 128GB', 'smartphones', 280000, 280000, 224000, 15, 0.19, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-11-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone 11 remains a durable and capable smartphone with its A13 Bionic chip still faster than many mid-range competitors today. The 6.1-inch Liquid Retina HD LCD display with True Tone and haptic touch provides comfortable viewing for media, web browsing, and apps. The dual 12MP camera system introduced Night mode, an Ultra Wide lens with 120° field of view capturing 4x more scene, and 2x optical zoom out. Portrait mode with advanced bokeh and Depth Control works with both human and pet subjects. The 12MP TrueDepth front camera supports slow-motion selfies (slofies) and 4K video at 60fps. Face ID is fast and secure for authentication, Apple Pay, and app logins. The aerospace-grade aluminum and glass design is IP68 water resistant to 2 meters for up to 30 minutes. Spatial audio playback with Dolby Atmos, all-day battery life, and iOS 18 support keep this device relevant for budget-conscious buyers seeking Apple quality and ecosystem access.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 224000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-11-128gb.jpg', 246400, 4.4, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

('apple-iphone-se-2022-128gb', 'Apple iPhone SE 2022 128GB', 'smartphones', 220000, 220000, 176000, 18, 0.14, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-se-2022-128gb.jpg', 'The iPhone SE (2022) combines the beloved compact design of the iPhone 8 with the formidable A15 Bionic chip the same processor found in the iPhone 13 series making it a performance powerhouse in a pocket-friendly 4.7-inch form factor. The 4.7-inch Retina HD display with True Tone, wide color (P3), and haptic touch provides sharp, comfortable viewing. The single 12MP Wide camera (f/1.8) punches far above its weight, supporting Deep Fusion, Smart HDR 4, Photographic Styles, and Portrait mode all powered by the A15 Bionic Neural Engine. 4K video at 60fps with extended dynamic range and cinematic stabilization exceeds expectations at this price point. Touch ID offers fast, secure authentication in a familiar home button format. 5G connectivity, IP67 water and dust resistance, and the durable glass-aluminum construction with the toughest glass in a smartphone at launch ensure longevity. Running iOS 18 smoothly with up to 15 hours of video playback, this is the ideal entry into the Apple ecosystem.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 176000, '/assets/products/apple-iphone-se-2022-128gb.jpg', 193600, 4.4, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

-- Apple AirPods
('apple-airpods-pro-2nd-gen-usb-c', 'Apple AirPods Pro (2nd Gen) with USB-C', 'audio', 280000, 280000, 235000, 35, 0.056, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-pro-2nd-gen-usb-c.jpg', 'Apple AirPods Pro (2nd generation) with USB-C and MagSafe Charging Case represent the pinnacle of personal audio. Powered by the Apple H2 chip, they deliver up to 2x more active noise cancellation than the previous generation, adaptive transparency that dynamically adjusts to environmental sounds, and personalized spatial audio with dynamic head tracking for an immersive, theater-like experience. The all-new low-distortion driver and custom amplifier produce richer bass and crystal-clear highs across all volume levels. Touch control on the stem allows precise volume adjustments. The USB-C/MagSafe charging case includes a built-in speaker for Find My location, a lanyard loop, and delivers up to 30 hours total listening time (6 hours ANC on). Sweat and water resistant (IPX4) for both earbuds and case. Features include seamless one-touch pairing, automatic switching between Apple devices, audio sharing, Announce Notifications, and Conversation Boost. With four silicone ear tip sizes (XS, S, M, L) for a customizable, secure fit, the AirPods Pro 2 are the ultimate wireless earbuds for Apple users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 235000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-pro-2nd-gen-usb-c.jpg', 258500, 4.9, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-airpods-3rd-gen', 'Apple AirPods (3rd Gen) with Lightning Charging Case', 'audio', 165000, 165000, 135000, 40, 0.048, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-3rd-gen.jpg', 'Apple AirPods (3rd generation) completely redesign the iconic earbuds with a contoured shape that sits at the perfect angle for comfort and directing sound into the ear. Spatial audio with dynamic head tracking places sounds all around you, creating an immersive three-dimensional listening experience for music, shows, and movies. Adaptive EQ automatically tunes music to the shape of your ear for consistently rich, detailed sound. The Apple-designed H1 chip enables seamless connectivity, one-touch pairing, and low latency for gaming and video calls. Force sensor controls allow easy management of music, calls, and Siri. Both the earbuds and the Lightning Charging Case are IPX4 sweat and water resistant, making them workout and rain ready. Battery life provides up to 6 hours of listening time (5 hours with spatial audio) and up to 30 hours total with the MagSafe-compatible charging case. With skin-detect sensors for accurate in-ear detection, Announce Notifications, and Audio Sharing, AirPods 3 offer premium features at a more accessible price.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 135000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-3rd-gen.jpg', 148500, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-airpods-2nd-gen', 'Apple AirPods (2nd Gen) with Lightning Charging Case', 'audio', 95000, 95000, 78000, 55, 0.04, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-2nd-gen.jpg', 'Apple AirPods (2nd generation) remain one of the best-selling wireless earbuds worldwide for their seamless Apple ecosystem integration, reliable performance, and iconic design. Powered by the Apple H1 chip, they deliver a stable, low-latency wireless connection and faster switching between Apple devices up to 2x faster than the first generation. The chip enables hands-free "Hey Siri" voice commands to change songs, make calls, adjust volume, or get directions. Optical sensors and motion accelerometers automatically detect when the AirPods are in your ears, pausing playback when removed. The Lightning Charging Case provides more than 24 hours of total battery life, with up to 5 hours of listening time on a single charge and 3 hours of talk time. A quick 15-minute charge delivers 3 hours of listening. Dual beamforming microphones, dual optical sensors, and speech-detecting accelerometers work together to filter out background noise for crystal-clear calls. With their universal fit and legendary ease of use, AirPods 2 continue to be the go-to choice for millions.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 78000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-2nd-gen.jpg', 85800, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-airpods-max-usb-c', 'Apple AirPods Max (USB-C) Over-Ear Headphones', 'audio', 580000, 580000, 490000, 12, 0.385, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-max-usb-c.jpg', 'Apple AirPods Max with USB-C redefine over-ear headphone luxury. The custom-built 40mm Apple-designed dynamic drivers produce rich, detailed audio with ultra-low distortion across the entire frequency spectrum. Each ear cup houses an Apple H2 chip (updated) delivering computational audio for breakthrough performance including adaptive EQ, active noise cancellation with up to 2x improvement, and personalized spatial audio with dynamic head tracking. The breathable knit mesh canopy spanning the stainless steel headband distributes weight evenly to reduce on-head pressure, while the memory foam ear cushions with an acoustic seal deliver exceptional comfort for extended listening sessions. The Digital Crown, inspired by Apple Watch, provides precise volume and playback control. USB-C charging and audio, a Smart Case that preserves battery in an ultra-low-power state, and seamless switching between iPhone, iPad, and Mac complete the premium experience. Available in five stunning colors with up to 20 hours of ANC playback, AirPods Max deliver audiophile-grade listening in a statement design.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 490000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-max-usb-c.jpg', 539000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1),

('apple-airpods-4-anc', 'Apple AirPods 4 with Active Noise Cancellation', 'audio', 210000, 210000, 172000, 30, 0.044, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-4-anc.jpg', 'Apple AirPods 4 with Active Noise Cancellation bring high-end features to the open-ear design. Powered by the Apple H2 chip, they offer active noise cancellation, adaptive audio that dynamically blends Transparency and ANC based on your environment, and personalized spatial audio with dynamic head tracking. The redesigned acoustic architecture and low-distortion driver deliver remarkably rich, balanced sound. Conversation Awareness automatically lowers volume when speaking, while Voice Isolation enhances call clarity in noisy environments. The compact USB-C charging case supports wireless charging (including Apple Watch charger) with a built-in speaker for Find My. IP54 dust, sweat, and water resistance ensures durability for active lifestyles. With up to 5 hours of listening (4 hours with ANC) and 30 hours with the case, plus fast charging (5 minutes = 1 hour), AirPods 4 ANC are the perfect everyday earbuds.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 172000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-4-anc.jpg', 189200, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1),

('apple-airpods-4', 'Apple AirPods 4 Standard', 'audio', 145000, 145000, 118000, 40, 0.043, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-4.jpg', 'Apple AirPods 4 deliver a massive upgrade to the world''s most popular earbuds. The H2 chip powers improved audio with a new acoustic architecture, low-distortion driver, and high dynamic range amplifier for richer bass and crisper highs. Personalized spatial audio with dynamic head tracking creates an immersive soundstage. The redesigned shape uses advanced modeling to fit more ears comfortably. IP54 rating provides dust, sweat, and water resistance. The USB-C charging case is the smallest in the industry. Features include force sensor controls, seamless one-touch pairing and iCloud device switching, Audio Sharing, and hands-free Siri. Battery life delivers up to 6.5 hours of listening and 30 hours total with the charging case. Voice Isolation ensures crystal-clear calls. AirPods 4 are the entry into premium Apple audio at an accessible price point.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 118000, '/assets/products/apple-airpods-4.jpg', 129800, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

-- Apple Chargers & Cables
('apple-20w-usb-c-power-adapter', 'Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter', 'chargers', 18500, 18500, 14800, 150, 0.06, '/assets/products/apple-20w-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 'The Apple 20W USB-C Power Adapter delivers fast, efficient charging for all USB-C devices including the entire iPhone and iPad lineup. With 20 watts of power delivery, it charges iPhone 16 series to 50% in just 30 minutes a critical feature for busy professionals and travelers. The compact, lightweight design (smaller than previous 18W adapter) makes it ideal for carrying in bags, purses, or pockets. Advanced safety features include overvoltage protection, temperature monitoring, and intelligent power management to protect your devices during charging cycles. Built with Apple''s rigorous quality standards, it''s compatible with any USB-C cable including USB-C to Lightning for older iPhones and the included USB-C cable for iPad and newer iPhones. Perfect as a spare charger for home, office, travel, or as a replacement. Note: charging cable sold separately for optimal configuration. Designed and tested to meet international safety standards including IEC 60950-1 and IEC 62368-1.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 14800, '/assets/products/apple-20w-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 16280, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-30w-usb-c-power-adapter', 'Apple 30W USB-C Power Adapter', 'chargers', 32000, 32000, 26800, 80, 0.10, '/assets/products/apple-30w-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 'The Apple 30W USB-C Power Adapter offers fast, versatile charging with enough power to charge MacBook Air, iPad Pro, iPhone, and AirPods at optimal speeds. With 30 watts of USB Power Delivery (USB-PD), it charges MacBook Air from 0 to 50% in approximately 45 minutes and an iPhone 16 Pro Max to 50% in under 30 minutes. The compact, folding-plug design maximizes portability for travel and commuting. Compatible with the USB-C Charge Cable (sold separately) for charging, syncing, and data transfer. Advanced thermal management and intelligent charging protection ensure safe, reliable performance across years of use. Features include automatic device detection to deliver optimal wattage, universal voltage compatibility (100-240V) for international travel, and Apple''s high-quality components for peace of mind. Ideal for users with multiple Apple devices who want a single, travel-friendly power adapter.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 26800, '/assets/products/apple-30w-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 29480, 4.7, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-35w-dual-usb-c-power-adapter', 'Apple 35W Dual USB-C Power Adapter Compact', 'chargers', 42000, 42000, 35000, 70, 0.11, '/assets/products/apple-35w-dual-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 'The Apple 35W Dual USB-C Compact Power Adapter lets you fast-charge two devices simultaneously from a single wall outlet. Whether it''s an iPhone and Apple Watch, iPhone and AirPods, or two iPhones, the dual ports intelligently distribute 35 watts total to provide optimized charging speeds for each connected device. The ultra-compact, foldable plug design (the same size as the single-port 30W adapter) makes it remarkably travel-friendly. USB Power Delivery 3.0 ensures fast, efficient charging across the full range of Apple USB-C devices. Dynamic power allocation automatically adjusts wattage distribution based on each device''s needs for example, 20W to iPhone and 15W to Apple Watch. Built with premium components including GaN technology for heat reduction and Apple''s comprehensive safety systems. Works worldwide with 100-240V input. The definitive charger for Apple users who carry multiple devices daily.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 35000, '/assets/products/apple-35w-dual-usb-c-power-adapter.jpg', 38500, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1),

('apple-magsafe-charger', 'Apple MagSafe Wireless Charger', 'chargers', 32000, 32000, 26800, 85, 0.06, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-charger.jpg', 'The Apple MagSafe Charger revolutionizes wireless charging with perfectly aligned magnets that snap into place for effortless, high-speed wireless charging up to 15W for iPhone 12 through iPhone 16 series. The precisely tuned magnetic array automatically aligns to the optimal charging position every time no more misaligned coils or failed charges. Compatible with Qi2 and Qi wireless charging standards for AirPods and other devices. The soft silicone finish protects your iPhone from scratches while providing a premium tactile experience. The integrated USB-C cable (1m) ensures reliable power delivery from any USB-C power adapter (20W or higher recommended for 15W charging). Features include foreign object detection, temperature management, and intelligent charging optimization to protect battery health. Works seamlessly with MagSafe cases for a secure magnetic attachment. A transformative charging experience that also works as a convenient stand for hands-free FaceTime calls and media viewing.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 26800, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-charger.jpg', 29480, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-magsafe-duo-charger', 'Apple MagSafe Duo Wireless Charger', 'chargers', 95000, 95000, 78000, 35, 0.14, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-duo-charger.jpg', 'The Apple MagSafe Duo Charger elegantly charges both your iPhone (MagSafe) and Apple Watch (magnetic charging puck) simultaneously. Its foldable design transforms from a compact, easily packable square into a dual-device charging station in seconds. Delivers up to 14W to iPhone (11W with 20W adapter, 14W with 27W+ USB-C PD adapter) and fast Apple Watch charging. Premium materials include a soft-touch silicone exterior, polished stainless steel hinges, and a durable woven USB-C to Lightning cable (1m) included. Perfect for the nightstand, office desk, or travel it folds flat to slip into any bag. Intelligent power management prevents overheating and optimizes charging speeds. The magnetic alignment ensures perfect positioning every time without fiddling. Compatible with all MagSafe iPhones and all Apple Watch models (including Ultra). The ultimate two-in-one travel charger for the Apple ecosystem.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 78000, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-duo-charger.jpg', 85800, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

('apple-usb-c-charge-cable-2m', 'Apple USB-C Charge Cable (2m)', 'accessories', 18000, 18000, 14500, 200, 0.05, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-charge-cable-2m.jpg', 'The Apple USB-C Charge Cable (2 meters) offers the perfect length for reaching distant outlets while charging, syncing, and transferring data between USB-C devices. The 2-meter length provides exceptional flexibility for use on nightstands, couches, desks, or in vehicles. Supports USB 2.0 data transfer speeds up to 480Mbps and charging up to 60W. Compatible with all USB-C devices including iPhone 15/16 series, iPad, MacBook Air, and accessories. The durable, tangle-free design with Apple''s rigorous testing ensures it withstands the wear and tear of daily use. The reversible USB-C connectors on both ends make plugging in effortless in any orientation. Works seamlessly with Apple 20W, 30W, 35W, 61W, 67W, 96W, and 140W USB-C Power Adapters (sold separately). An essential everyday cable that combines Apple quality with practical length.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 14500, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-charge-cable-2m.jpg', 15950, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-usb-c-to-lightning-cable-1m', 'Apple USB-C to Lightning Cable (1m)', 'accessories', 14500, 14500, 11500, 180, 0.03, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-to-lightning-cable-1m.jpg', 'The Apple USB-C to Lightning Cable enables fast charging for iPhone 8 through iPhone 14 series when paired with a USB-C Power Adapter (18W or higher). The 1-meter length is ideal for everyday use at desks, in cars, or with power banks. MFi certified with Apple''s original C89 connector ensures perfect compatibility, reliable charging, and uninterrupted data syncing. Supports USB 2.0 data transfer up to 480Mbps between iPhone/iPad and USB-C Mac, PC, or iPad. The durable design with strain relief at both connector ends withstands extensive plugging and unplugging cycles. Charge iPhone to 50% in just 30 minutes with a 20W or higher USB-C adapter. Works with all Lightning iPhones, AirPods cases, and compatible iPads. An essential cable for millions of iPhone users transitioning to USB-C power adapters.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 11500, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-to-lightning-cable-1m.jpg', 12650, 4.6, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-usb-c-to-usb-c-cable-1m', 'Apple USB-C to USB-C Woven Charge Cable (1m)', 'accessories', 16500, 16500, 13200, 150, 0.04, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-to-usb-c-cable-1m.jpg', 'The Apple USB-C to USB-C Woven Charge Cable (1m) combines durability with premium aesthetics. The braided, tangle-free design resists fraying and tangling, providing long-lasting reliability for daily charging and syncing. Supports charging up to 60W and USB 2.0 data transfer up to 480Mbps. The 1-meter length is ideal for desktop, car, and power bank use. Fully compatible with iPhone 15/16 series, iPad, MacBook Air, AirPods, and all USB-C devices. Apple''s precision-engineered connectors ensure a secure fit in all USB-C ports, including those with cases. Designed and tested to withstand 10,000+ bend cycles at stress points. The woven nylon exterior with anodized aluminum connector shells provides a premium look and feel while protecting internal components. A versatile, everyday cable that embodies Apple quality.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 13200, '/assets/products/apple-usb-c-to-usb-c-cable-1m.jpg', 14520, 4.7, 0, 'Apple', 1, 0),

('apple-watch-magnetic-charging-cable-1m', 'Apple Watch Magnetic Fast Charging Cable (1m) USB-C', 'wearables', 22000, 22000, 17800, 95, 0.04, '/assets/products/apple-watch-magnetic-fast-charging-cable-1m.jpg', 'The Apple Watch Magnetic Fast Charging Cable (USB-C, 1m) enables accelerated charging for Apple Watch Series 7, 8, 9, 10, and Ultra models charging from 0-80% in approximately 45 minutes (33% faster than standard). The perfectly aligned magnetic connection snaps into place automatically against the back of the Apple Watch for effortless attachment. The 1-meter cable provides comfortable reach from wall outlets to nightstands and desks. The USB-C connector works with Apple USB-C power adapters (20W recommended for fast charging) and third-party USB-C PD chargers. Compatible with all Apple Watch models, with fast-charging support on Series 7 and later. The sleek, minimalist white design with soft-touch cable coating resists tangling and abrasion. Engineered to Apple''s exacting standards for safety, reliability, and long-term performance. An essential spare or replacement for home, office, or travel.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 17800, '/assets/products/apple-watch-magnetic-fast-charging-cable-1m.jpg', 19580, 4.7, 1, 'Apple', 0, 0),

('apple-magsafe-battery-pack', 'Apple MagSafe Battery Pack', 'power', 85000, 85000, 68000, 30, 0.115, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-battery-pack.jpg', 'The Apple MagSafe Battery Pack attaches magnetically to the back of iPhone 12 through iPhone 16 series, providing on-the-go wireless charging without cables or bulk. Designed for one-handed attachment and removal, the compact, lightweight design adds minimal weight (approx. 115g) while delivering up to 70% additional charge for iPhone 15/16 models. Intelligent charging management communicates with iOS to optimize charging speed and preserve battery health by pausing at 80% when appropriate. The battery pack itself charges via Lightning cable (not included) and supports pass-through charging when connected to a 20W+ adapter charge both the battery pack and iPhone simultaneously. The soft-touch silicone exterior protects the iPhone finish while providing a secure grip. On-screen battery widget displays the MagSafe Battery Pack charge status alongside iPhone and connected accessories. Perfect for travelers, long workdays, and anyone needing reliable backup power in a seamlessly integrated Apple accessory.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 68000, '/assets/products/apple-magsafe-battery-pack.jpg', 74800, 4.5, 0, 'Apple', 0, 0),

