('samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-1tb', 'Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 1TB', 'smartphones', 2800000, 2800000, 2240000, 8, 0.23, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-1tb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra represents the absolute zenith of Android smartphone engineering. Built around a massive 6.9-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with QHD+ resolution, 120Hz adaptive refresh rate (1-120Hz), and a peak brightness of 2600 nits, every visual is breathtaking. The Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy chipset, built on a 3nm process, delivers desktop-class performance with a 40% GPU uplift and dedicated AI accelerator for Galaxy AI features including real-time call translation, circle-to-search, generative photo editing, and AI-powered note summarization. The quad-camera system is the most versatile ever: a 200MP main sensor with advanced pixel-binning for unmatched detail, a 50MP 5x telephoto with 10x optical-quality zoom, a 10MP 3x telephoto, and a 50MP ultra-wide with autofocus for macro photography. The integrated S Pen now with IP68 water resistance unlocks precision workflows, drawing, and Air gestures. A 5000mAh battery with 45W Super Fast Charging 2.0, 25W wireless, and 15W reverse wireless charging keeps you powered all day. The titanium frame, Gorilla Armor 2 glass, and IP68 rating ensure durability worthy of the flagship title. One UI 7 with 7 years of OS updates makes this a long-term investment.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 2240000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-1tb.jpg', 2464000, 4.9, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-512gb', 'Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 512GB', 'smartphones', 2400000, 2400000, 1920000, 10, 0.23, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-512gb.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 512GB packs the full flagship experience with abundant storage for 8K videos, high-resolution photos, and pro creative work. The Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor with a vapor chamber cooling system ensures sustained peak performance during gaming, video editing, and AI processing. The stunning 6.9-inch QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with Vision Booster technology adjusts color and contrast intelligently based on ambient lighting. The quad-camera system 200MP wide, 50MP periscope telephoto (5x optical, 10x quality), 10MP telephoto (3x), and 50MP ultra-wide captures professional-grade content in any scenario. Nightography mode now uses AI to dramatically improve low-light video and portrait quality. Galaxy AI features including Interpreter, Chat Assist, Transcript Assist, and Generative Edit transform productivity. The 5000mAh battery with 45W wired and Fast Wireless Charging 2.0 provides all-day endurance. Samsung DeX, Knox security, and the integrated S Pen with air commands complete the most powerful productivity and creativity tool in the Galaxy lineup.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1920000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-512gb.jpg', 2112000, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-s25-plus-512gb', 'Samsung Galaxy S25 Plus 512GB', 'smartphones', 1800000, 1800000, 1440000, 12, 0.21, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-plus-512gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy S25 Plus strikes the perfect balance between large-screen immersion and everyday practicality. The 6.7-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with QHD+ resolution, 120Hz adaptive refresh, and 2600 nits peak brightness delivers flagship visuals in a more manageable size than the Ultra. Powered by the Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor, it handles intense gaming, 4K video editing, and Galaxy AI features with fluid ease. The triple camera system features a 50MP main sensor with Dual Pixel Pro autofocus, 12MP ultra-wide with 120° FOV, and 10MP telephoto with 3x optical zoom all enhanced by the ProVisual Engine and Nightography capabilities. Galaxy AI brings circle-to-search, live translate in calls and messages, and AI photo editing tools. A 4900mAh battery with 45W Super Fast Charging 2.0, 25W wireless charging, and Wireless PowerShare keeps all your devices charged. The Armor Aluminum frame, Gorilla Glass Victus 2, IP68 rating, and Samsung Knox multi-layered security protect your investment. Seven years of OS and security updates ensure this device stays current through 2032.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1440000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-plus-512gb.jpg', 1584000, 4.7, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-s25-256gb', 'Samsung Galaxy S25 256GB', 'smartphones', 1350000, 1350000, 1080000, 15, 0.20, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-256gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy S25 brings flagship innovation in a perfectly compact 6.2-inch form factor. The Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with FHD+ resolution, 120Hz adaptive refresh, and 2600 nits peak brightness delivers stunning clarity that fits comfortably in one hand. The Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy chipset with 12GB RAM ensures years of swift, responsive performance. The triple camera system 50MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, and 10MP telephoto with 3x optical zoom captures exceptional photos and videos day or night with the ProVisual Engine and advanced Nightography. Galaxy AI features transform the user experience: circle-to-search on any screen, real-time call and message translation, web and note summarization, and generative photo editing. The 4000mAh battery with 25W Super Fast Charging and 25W wireless charging easily lasts a full day. Premium materials include an Armor Aluminum 2.0 frame, Gorilla Glass Victus 2 front and back, and IP68 water resistance. Samsung DeX enables a desktop experience when connected to a monitor. Seven years of guaranteed updates make this a smart long-term investment.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1080000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-256gb.jpg', 1188000, 4.7, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-z-fold-6-512gb', 'Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 6 512GB', 'smartphones', 2500000, 2500000, 2100000, 8, 0.26, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-z-fold-6-512gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 6 redefines mobile productivity with a revolutionary foldable design. Unfolded, the stunning 7.6-inch QXGA+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X Infinity Flex Display with 120Hz adaptive refresh rate becomes a tablet-sized canvas for multitasking, content consumption, and creativity. The 6.3-inch HD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X cover display provides a premium phone experience when folded. Powered by the Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor with 12GB RAM, it handles up to three apps simultaneously with Multi-Active Window and supports Samsung DeX for a desktop experience. The camera system features a 50MP main camera, 12MP ultra-wide, and 10MP telephoto with 3x optical zoom and 30x Space Zoom. A 4MP under-display camera and 10MP cover selfie camera handle video calls. The improved Flex Hinge is thinner, lighter, and more durable with IPX8 water resistance. A 4400mAh dual battery with 25W Super Fast Charging powers through the day. Galaxy AI enhances the foldable experience with AI-powered multitasking, Flex Mode optimized apps, and seven years of updates.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 2100000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-z-fold-6-512gb.jpg', 2310000, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-z-flip-6-512gb', 'Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 6 512GB', 'smartphones', 1600000, 1600000, 1320000, 12, 0.19, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-z-flip-6-512gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 6 brings foldable innovation in a stylish, pocketable design. When flipped open, the 6.7-inch FHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X Infinity Flex Display delivers a stunning viewing experience. The dramatically improved 3.4-inch Super AMOLED Flex Window on the cover enables full app interactions, detailed notifications, customizable clock faces, and high-quality selfies using the main cameras. The Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor with 12GB RAM delivers flagship performance. The dual rear cameras 50MP main and 12MP ultra-wide leverage the FlexCam feature for hands-free group photos, vlogging, and creative angles. Flex Mode automatically adapts apps like YouTube, camera, and video calling for the half-folded position. The improved Flex Hinge with IPX8 water resistance, Gorilla Glass Victus 2, and Armor Aluminum frame provide durability. A 4000mAh battery with 25W wired and 15W wireless charging keeps up with daily use. Galaxy AI features including Photo Assist, Interpreter, and Flex Mode optimization enhance the experience. Seven years of updates ensure lasting value.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1320000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-z-flip-6-512gb.jpg', 1452000, 4.7, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-512gb', 'Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra 512GB', 'smartphones', 1950000, 1950000, 1560000, 10, 0.23, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-512gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra remains a titanium-clad productivity beast. The 6.8-inch QHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with 120Hz adaptive refresh and 2600 nits peak brightness is protected by Gorilla Armor with dramatically reduced reflections. The Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 for Galaxy delivers exceptional performance for gaming, AI features, and creative workflows. The quad-camera system features a 200MP main sensor, 50MP 5x telephoto, 10MP 3x telephoto, and 12MP ultra-wide. Galaxy AI introduced with this generation includes circle-to-search, live translate, transcript assist, and generative photo editing. The 5000mAh battery with 45W charging, integrated S Pen with IP68 rating, titanium frame, and Samsung Knox security platform make this a reliable flagship. Seven years of OS updates ensure longevity.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1560000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-ultra-512gb.jpg', 1716000, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-s24-256gb', 'Samsung Galaxy S24 256GB', 'smartphones', 1200000, 1200000, 960000, 15, 0.20, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-256gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy S24 is a compact flagship with a 6.2-inch FHD+ Dynamic AMOLED 2X display, Snapdragon 8 Gen 3 processor, and 12GB RAM. The triple camera system (50MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, 10MP telephoto with 3x zoom) delivers versatile photography. Galaxy AI features circle-to-search, live translate, note assist, and generative edit enhance daily productivity. The 4000mAh battery with 25W fast charging, Armor Aluminum 2.0 frame, IP68 rating, and seven years of updates make it a compelling compact flagship.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 960000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-s24-256gb.jpg', 1056000, 4.7, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-a56-5g-8gb-256gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A56 5G 8GB RAM 256GB', 'smartphones', 520000, 520000, 416000, 18, 0.21, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a56-5g-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy A56 5G brings premium features to the mid-range. The 6.7-inch Super AMOLED Plus display with 120Hz refresh rate and 1000 nits brightness delivers smooth, vibrant visuals. The Exynos 1580 processor with 8GB RAM handles multitasking, gaming, and 5G connectivity with ease. The triple camera system features a 50MP main with OIS, 12MP ultra-wide, and 5MP macro lens all enhanced by AI-powered features. Samsung Knox security, IP67 water resistance, a 5000mAh battery with 25W Super Fast Charging, and stereo speakers with Dolby Atmos provide a flagship-like experience. Four years of OS updates and five years of security patches ensure lasting value.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 416000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a56-5g-8gb-256gb.jpg', 457600, 4.6, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-a36-6gb-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A36 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 465317, 465317, 372254, 28, 0.21, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a36-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy A36 redefines mid-range value with its stunning 6.6-inch Super AMOLED display featuring 120Hz refresh rate and Vision Booster for excellent outdoor visibility. Powered by the Snapdragon 6 Gen 3 processor with 6GB RAM, it delivers smooth performance for apps, gaming, and streaming. The 50MP main camera with OIS captures sharp photos even in low light, supported by an 8MP ultra-wide and 2MP macro lens. Samsung''s commitment to software is evident with four years of Android OS upgrades and five years of security updates. The 5000mAh battery with 25W fast charging, IP67 water and dust resistance, microSD expansion up to 1TB, and Samsung Knox security platform make this an outstanding all-rounder. Stereo speakers with Dolby Atmos enhance entertainment.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 372254, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a36-6gb-128gb.jpg', 409479, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-a26-5g-6gb-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A26 5G 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 365000, 365000, 292000, 25, 0.21, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a26-5g-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy A26 5G makes 5G connectivity accessible without compromising on quality. The 6.5-inch Super AMOLED display with 90Hz refresh rate and 800 nits brightness provides excellent visuals for streaming, gaming, and browsing. The MediaTek Dimensity 6100+ processor with 6GB RAM ensures responsive performance. The 50MP main camera, 5MP ultra-wide, and 2MP macro lens capture everyday moments with AI enhancements. A massive 5000mAh battery with 25W charging, side fingerprint sensor, Samsung Knox security, expandable storage up to 1TB, and IP67 rating round out a compelling package. Four Android upgrades and five years of security updates provide peace of mind.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 292000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a26-5g-6gb-128gb.jpg', 321200, 4.6, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-a16-6gb-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A16 6GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 280000, 280000, 224000, 20, 0.20, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a16-6gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy A16 delivers exceptional value with a 6.6-inch Super AMOLED display, MediaTek Helio G99 processor, and 6GB RAM. The 50MP main camera with F1.8 aperture captures detailed photos, supported by a 5MP ultra-wide and 2MP macro sensor. A 5000mAh battery with 25W fast charging provides multi-day endurance. Features include Samsung Knox, microSD expansion, side fingerprint sensor, and IP54 splash resistance. Four OS upgrades ensure longevity.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 224000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a16-6gb-128gb.jpg', 246400, 4.4, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-a07-4gb-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy A07 4GB RAM 128GB', 'smartphones', 168869, 168869, 135095, 35, 0.21, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a07-4gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy A07 offers a stunning 6.7-inch PLS LCD display, dependable MediaTek Helio G85 processor, and 5000mAh battery with 25W fast charging. The 50MP main camera with F1.8 aperture and 2MP depth sensor capture clear photos. 128GB internal storage with microSD expansion up to 1TB provides ample space. Samsung Knox security, dual SIM, side fingerprint sensor, and Samsung''s trusted One UI experience make this a bestseller for quality-conscious buyers seeking reliability at an affordable price.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 135095, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-a07-4gb-128gb.jpg', 148605, 4.6, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

-- Samsung Galaxy Buds
('samsung-galaxy-buds-3-pro', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro', 'audio', 220000, 220000, 180000, 40, 0.058, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-3-pro.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 Pro represent a complete redesign with a stem-style form factor and blade light indicators. Dual amplifiers with 2-way speakers (10.5mm woofer and 6.1mm planar tweeter) deliver exceptional clarity from deep bass to crisp highs. Adaptive ANC with three microphones per earbud intelligently adjusts noise cancellation based on your environment. 360 Audio with head tracking, Hi-Fi 24-bit audio with Samsung Seamless Codec (SSC), and Galaxy AI-powered features including real-time translation through Interpreter and Adaptive EQ. IP57 water resistance, up to 6 hours ANC playback (26 hours with case), wireless charging, and Bluetooth 5.4 with LE Audio and Auracast. The redesigned case with translucent lid and improved ergonomics ensures all-day comfort.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 180000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-3-pro.jpg', 198000, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-buds-3', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 3', 'audio', 145000, 145000, 118000, 50, 0.052, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-3.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 3 offer premium features in an accessible open-type design. 11mm dynamic drivers with enhanced bass deliver rich, balanced sound. Active Noise Cancellation with adaptive technology, 3 microphones for crystal-clear calls, and IP57 water resistance. Galaxy AI features include real-time Interpreter translation and voice command controls. Up to 5 hours ANC playback (24 hours with case), fast USB-C and wireless charging, Bluetooth 5.4, and seamless Galaxy ecosystem integration. The comfortable open-ear design is ideal for all-day wear.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 118000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-3.jpg', 129800, 4.6, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-buds-fe', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds FE', 'audio', 85000, 85000, 68000, 60, 0.054, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-fe.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds FE bring the essential Galaxy Buds experience at an attractive price. Active Noise Cancellation, 3 microphones with beamforming for clear calls, and 12mm drivers with AKG tuning deliver immersive sound. Auto switch seamlessly connects between Galaxy devices. Up to 8.5 hours playback (ANC off, 30 hours with case) and IPX2 water resistance. Compact design with wingtips for a secure, comfortable fit. Perfect entry into Samsung''s audio ecosystem.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 68000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-fe.jpg', 74800, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-buds-2-pro', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 Pro', 'audio', 160000, 160000, 128000, 35, 0.055, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-2-pro.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Buds 2 Pro deliver studio-quality 24-bit Hi-Fi audio with Samsung Seamless Codec. Intelligent ANC with Voice Detect automatically lowers volume and activates ambient sound when speaking. 360 Audio with Direct Multi-Channel creates immersive spatial audio. IPX7 water resistance withstands submersion. Up to 5 hours ANC playback (18 hours with case), wireless charging, and compact matte-finish case. Three microphones with high SNR ensure clear calls in noisy environments.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 128000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-buds-2-pro.jpg', 140800, 4.7, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 0),

