('samsung-galaxy-watch-7-44mm', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 44mm Bluetooth', 'wearables', 350000, 350000, 280000, 20, 0.05, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-7-44mm.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 44mm features the new 3nm Exynos W1000 processor 3x faster CPU and 30% more power efficient than its predecessor. Wear OS 5 with One UI Watch 6 delivers a smooth, feature-rich experience. BioActive Sensor 2.0 provides enhanced heart rate monitoring, ECG, blood pressure monitoring, body composition analysis, and sleep apnea detection. Galaxy AI features include Energy Score for daily readiness, Wellness Tips, and advanced sleep coaching. 2000-nit Super AMOLED display with sapphire crystal, 5ATM + IP68 water resistance, MIL-STD-810H durability, 40-hour battery life, and seamless Galaxy ecosystem integration.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 280000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-7-44mm.jpg', 308000, 4.7, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-watch-7-40mm', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 40mm Bluetooth', 'wearables', 280000, 280000, 224000, 18, 0.04, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-7-40mm.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch 7 40mm packs the same Exynos W1000 processor and comprehensive health features in a smaller, lighter form. BioActive Sensor 2.0 with heart rate, ECG, body composition, and sleep tracking. Galaxy AI-powered Energy Score and sleep coaching provide personalized health insights. 40-hour battery life, sapphire crystal display, 5ATM + IP68, and Wear OS 5 with Google apps and services. Perfect for smaller wrists without compromising features.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 224000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-7-40mm.jpg', 246400, 4.6, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-watch-fe', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch FE 40mm', 'wearables', 180000, 180000, 145000, 25, 0.038, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-fe.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Watch FE makes Samsung''s health and wellness platform accessible. BioActive Sensor with heart rate, sleep tracking, body composition, and ECG. Super AMOLED display with sapphire crystal, 5ATM + IP68, Wear OS with Google services, and 30-hour battery. Aluminum case in three colors. An excellent entry point into smartwatch ownership.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 145000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-fe.jpg', 159500, 4.5, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

