('samsung-45w-super-fast-charger-2', 'Samsung 45W Super Fast Charging 2.0 Adapter USB-C', 'chargers', 28000, 28000, 22500, 120, 0.09, '/assets/products/samsung-45w-super-fast-charger-2.jpg', 'The Samsung 45W Super Fast Charging 2.0 Adapter charges compatible Galaxy devices (S23 Ultra and newer) from 0 to 65% in just 30 minutes. USB-C PD 3.0 with PPS support intelligently negotiates optimal charging speed. GaN technology enables compact size despite high output. Compatible with Galaxy S series, Z series, A series, Galaxy Book laptops, and any USB-C device. Built-in safeguards include overcurrent, overvoltage, and temperature protection. Samsung Genuine quality with 100-240V universal compatibility.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 22500, '/assets/products/samsung-45w-super-fast-charger-2.jpg', 24750, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-25w-super-fast-charger', 'Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger USB-C', 'chargers', 12500, 12500, 9800, 180, 0.07, '/assets/products/samsung-25w-super-fast-charger.jpg', 'The Samsung 25W Super Fast Charger is the essential adapter for Galaxy devices. USB-C Power Delivery 3.0 with PPS charges compatible Galaxy phones to 50% in 30 minutes. Compact, lightweight design perfect for travel. Backward compatible with all USB-C devices at optimal speeds. Samsung''s comprehensive safety system protects against overheating, overcurrent, and short circuits. Genuine Samsung quality avoid damaging your expensive devices with uncertified third-party chargers.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 9800, '/assets/products/samsung-25w-super-fast-charger.jpg', 10780, 4.7, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-65w-trio-charger', 'Samsung 65W Trio Adapter 3-Port GaN', 'chargers', 48000, 48000, 39000, 70, 0.15, '/assets/products/samsung-65w-trio-charger.jpg', 'The Samsung 65W Trio Adapter with GaN technology features 2 USB-C and 1 USB-A ports to charge three devices simultaneously. Charges Galaxy Book at 65W, Galaxy S series at 45W, and Galaxy Watch at 5W. Dynamic power allocation adjusts output when multiple devices are connected. Foldable plug and compact GaN design for travel. Samsung safety certified. Ideal for multi-device Samsung users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 39000, '/assets/products/samsung-65w-trio-charger.jpg', 42900, 4.6, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1),

('samsung-15w-wireless-charger-duo', 'Samsung 15W Wireless Charger Duo with USB-C', 'chargers', 42000, 42000, 34000, 55, 0.18, '/assets/products/samsung-15w-wireless-charger-duo.jpg', 'The Samsung Wireless Charger Duo charges two devices simultaneously phone at up to 15W Fast Wireless Charging 2.0 and earbuds/watch at up to 5W. The textured soft-touch surface holds devices securely and prevents scratches. LED indicators display charging status for each pad. Built-in cooling fan and foreign object detection ensure safe, efficient charging. Compatible with all Qi-certified smartphones and Samsung ecosystem devices. Includes 25W USB-C wall adapter and cable.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 34000, '/assets/products/samsung-15w-wireless-charger-duo.jpg', 37400, 4.6, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 0),

