('samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-ultra-1tb', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 Ultra 1TB 16GB RAM', 'tablets', 1850000, 1850000, 1500000, 8, 0.72, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-ultra-1tb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab S10 Ultra features a massive 14.6-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display with 120Hz refresh rate and anti-reflective coating. The MediaTek Dimensity 9300+ processor with 16GB RAM handles professional creative workflows, multitasking with up to 4 apps, and Samsung DeX for a full desktop experience. The included S Pen with 2.8ms latency offers a natural writing and drawing experience. IP68 water resistance on a tablet is unprecedented. Quad AKG-tuned speakers with Dolby Atmos, 11,200mAh battery with 45W fast charging, and Galaxy AI features make this the ultimate Android tablet for professionals and creatives.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 1500000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-s10-ultra-1tb.jpg', 1650000, 4.8, 1, 'Samsung', 1, 1),

('samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-plus-8gb-128gb', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A9 Plus 11" 8GB RAM 128GB', 'tablets', 320000, 320000, 260000, 20, 0.52, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-plus-8gb-128gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab A9 Plus features an expansive 11-inch TFT display with 90Hz refresh rate for smooth scrolling and gaming. The Snapdragon 695 processor with 8GB RAM handles multitasking with split-screen and pop-up view. Quad speakers with Dolby Atmos provide immersive audio. 7040mAh battery with 15W fast charging, microSD expansion, and Samsung DeX for desktop mode. Samsung Knox security and three OS upgrades. Ideal for entertainment, education, and light productivity.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 260000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-plus-8gb-128gb.jpg', 286000, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

('samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-4gb-64gb', 'Samsung Galaxy Tab A9 8.7" 4GB RAM 64GB', 'tablets', 145000, 145000, 116000, 25, 0.33, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-4gb-64gb.jpg', 'The Samsung Galaxy Tab A9 8.7-inch tablet offers portability and performance at an accessible price. The compact design fits in one hand while the TFT display with 60Hz provides clear visuals for reading, browsing, and streaming. MediaTek Helio G99 processor, 4GB RAM, dual speakers, and 5100mAh battery. microSD expansion up to 1TB, Samsung Knox for security, and metal frame for durability. Perfect for students, children, and casual media consumption.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 116000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-tab-a9-4gb-64gb.jpg', 127600, 4.5, 0, 'Samsung', 1, 0),

