('samsung-galaxy-smarttag-2', 'Samsung Galaxy SmartTag 2', 'accessories', 22000, 22000, 17500, 100, 0.013, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-smarttag-2.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy SmartTag 2 features a completely redesigned metal ring for easy attachment, IP67 water and dust resistance, and a battery life of up to 700 days (2x the original). Bluetooth 5.3 + UWB technology enables precise finding with AR view on Galaxy smartphones. Compass View guides you to your item with directional arrows. Lost Mode allows anyone with an NFC phone to view your contact information. Works seamlessly with the SmartThings Find network of millions of Galaxy devices. Compact, durable, and essential for keys, bags, and pets.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 17500, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-smarttag-2.jpg', 19250, 4.6, 1, 'Samsung', 0, 1),

