('samsung-galaxy-fit-3', 'Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 Fitness Tracker', 'wearables', 65000, 65000, 52000, 45, 0.021, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-fit-3.jpg', 'Samsung Galaxy Fit 3 features a 1.6-inch AMOLED Always-On display in a slim aluminum body. 5ATM + IP68 water resistance for swimming and workouts. 101 workout modes with automatic detection, continuous heart rate, SpO2, sleep tracking with coaching, and stress monitoring. 13-day battery life, quick-release band system, and Samsung Health integration. Lightweight at 18.5g. Perfect fitness companion for Galaxy users.', 1, unixepoch(), 1, 52000, '/assets/products/samsung-galaxy-fit-3.jpg', 57200, 4.4, 0, 'Samsung', 0, 1);
